#: src/splashes.rs:94
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can help translate Pipeline using <a href=\"https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."
msgstr ""
"Puoi aiutare a tradurre Pipeline usando <a href=\"https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:100
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The source code of Pipeline is hosted on <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/"
"schmiddi-on-mobile/pipeline\">GitLab</a>."
msgstr ""
"Il codice sorgente di Pipeline è ospitato su <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/"
"schmiddi-on-mobile/pipeline\">GitLab</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:106
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We have a <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix "
"room</a> where you can come and talk with us."
msgstr ""
"Abbiamo una <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">stanza "
"Matrix</a> dove puoi venire a parlare con noi."

#: src/splashes.rs:112
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has a <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/pipeline\">website</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline ha un <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/pipeline\">sito web</"
"a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:118
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can get Pipeline on <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."
msgstr ""
"Puoi ottenere Pipeline su <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:124
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> as the "
"video player."
msgstr ""
"Usiamo <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> come "
"lettore video."

#: src/splashes.rs:130
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</a> "
"and <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> to get data from YouTube."
msgstr ""
"Utilizziamo <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</"
"a> e <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> per recuperare i dati da "
"YouTube."

#: src/splashes.rs:136
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The creator of Pipeline has also built other applications, like <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."
msgstr ""
"Il creatore di Pipeline ha anche sviluppato altre applicazioni, come <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> e <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:142
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"When using Piped to fetch data, Pipeline will be able to fetch your "
"subscriptions faster with more public Piped instances. So consider <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hosting Piped</a> and "
"making it available for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Utilizzando Piped per recuperare i dati, Pipeline potrà caricare le tue "
"iscrizioni più velocemente con un numero maggiore di istanze Piped "
"pubbliche. Valuta quindi <a href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-"
"hosting/\">di ospitare Piped</a> e renderlo accessibile a tutti."

#: src/splashes.rs:148
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"No animals were harmed while making this application. But two cats were "
"petted."
msgstr ""
"Nessun animale è stato maltrattato durante la realizzazione di questa "
"applicazione. Ma due gatti sono stati coccolati."

#: src/splashes.rs:155
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Add videos to your watch-later list by bringing up their context menu, or "
"directly when watching videos."
msgstr ""
"Aggiungi video alla tua lista \"guarda più tardi\" aprendo il loro menu "
"contestuale, o direttamente mentre guardi i video."

#: src/splashes.rs:161
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Seeing something you don't like? You can hide videos from your feed based on "
"the title and uploader of the video."
msgstr ""
"Vedi qualcosa che non ti piace? Puoi nascondere video dal tuo feed basandoti "
"sul titolo e sul creatore del video."

#: src/splashes.rs:167
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can hide videos you already watched. Enable this by managing your "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"Puoi nascondere i video che hai già guardato. Attiva questa funzione "
"gestendo i tuoi filtri."

#: src/splashes.rs:173
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can quickly toggle on and off filters in the feed from the filter dialog."
msgstr ""
"Puoi attivare e disattivare rapidamente i filtri nel feed dalla finestra dei "
"filtri."

#: src/splashes.rs:179
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to keep your subscriptions from YouTube or NewPipe? You can import "
"those into Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Vuoi mantenere le tue iscrizioni da YouTube o NewPipe? Puoi importarle in "
"Pipeline."

#: src/splashes.rs:185
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to bring your own video player instead of the one built-in? You can "
"manage an external video player in the settings and tell Pipeline to use it "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Vuoi usare il tuo lettore video invece di quello integrato? Puoi gestire un "
"lettore video esterno nelle impostazioni e dire a Pipeline di usarlo come "
"predefinito."

#: src/splashes.rs:191
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You want to keep a video you watched? You can directly download it from the "
"video page."
msgstr ""
"Vuoi conservare un video che hai guardato? Puoi scaricarlo direttamente "
"dalla pagina del video."

#: src/splashes.rs:197
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to share a video? You can copy its URL to the clipboard directly from "
"the video page."
msgstr ""
"Vuoi condividere un video? Puoi copiare il suo URL negli appunti "
"direttamente dalla pagina del video."

#: src/splashes.rs:203
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Are you hosting your own Piped instance? You can tell Pipeline to use it in "
"the settings."
msgstr ""
"Stai ospitando la tua istanza di Piped? Puoi dire a Pipeline di usarla nelle "
"impostazioni."

#: src/splashes.rs:210
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Not interested in those splash texts? You can disable them in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Non ti interessano questi testi di benvenuto? Puoi disabilitarli nelle "
"impostazioni."

#: src/splashes.rs:216
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Don't like YouTube anymore? Pipeline also works with <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."
msgstr ""
"Non ti piace più YouTube? Pipeline funziona anche con <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:222
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Searching for something? Pipeline can help you with that and search for "
"channels and videos on YouTube and Peertube."
msgstr ""
"Stai cercando qualcosa? Pipeline può aiutarti e cercare canali e video su "
"YouTube e PeerTube."

#: src/splashes.rs:228
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has four different ways to fetch videos from YouTube. Just to be "
"sure you don't miss any of your precious cat videos."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline offre quattro metodi diversi per recuperare i video da YouTube. "
"Solo per essere sicuri che non ti perda nessuno dei tuoi preziosi video di "
"gatti."

#: src/splashes.rs:243
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Have ideas for further splash text? Tell us on <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/"
"%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix</a>."
msgstr ""
"Hai idee per altri testi di benvenuto? Diccelo su <a href=\"https://"
"matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:249
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pretty sure {year} will be the year of the Linux desktop."
msgstr "Sono abbastanza sicuro che il {year} sarà l'anno del desktop Linux."

#. Translators: A reference to the "I use Arch btw" meme.
#: src/splashes.rs:255
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "I can be used on Arch btw."
msgstr "Comunque funziono anche su Arch."

#: src/splashes.rs:260
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Do you want to advertise here? You can't."
msgstr "Vuoi fare pubblicità qui? Non è possibile."

#: src/splashes.rs:277
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "🎉 Pipeline turned {} years old today. Happy Birthday! 🎉"
msgstr "🎉 Oggi Pipeline compie {} anni. Buon compleanno! 🎉"

